  "notes": [
    "Hunters now recognize exposed survivors across a longer visible corridor, including during the opening grace period. Safe rooms, real wall cover and uncompromised hiding remain protected. Deliberate visible approaches receive a short warning before pursuit movement.",
    "Portable-light state is carried in co-op poses so the host can apply the same illuminated-survivor sight rules to every player. Each hunter still makes its own host-owned targeting decision.",
    "The Reaver carries a bounded animated black-smoke aura. Its approved detailed mesh, authored movement and attacks are retained.",
    "The Reaver has massive recorded footsteps and a deep demonic hunt scream. Nine separate footfalls follow its moving body at original pitch, with a dedicated darker hall return for its footsteps and screams.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
